{
    "title": "Pepi School: Fun Kid Games",
    "description": "\ud83c\udf93\ud83c\udfeb Hey there, Future Schoolmate! \ud83c\udfeb\ud83c\udf93\r\n \r\nWelcome to always expanding Pepi School world, where the learning never stops and the frozen winter fun never ends! Step into the world of education and create your frozen winter stories by attending your favourite classes, having winter fun with your classmates or decorating classroom of your choice.\r\n \r\n\ud83c\udf1f Sports Space:\r\nUnleash your inner athlete in our sports classroom! We encourage teamwork and staying active, whether you're kicking it on the soccer field or finding your zen on the yoga mat. So grab a ball or strike a pose, because our interactive environment and fun girl games are seriously fun this winter holiday season!\r\n \r\n\ud83d\udcda Learning Hub:\r\nDiscover school's main classroom and begin a journey of education and laughter! From learning math through puzzles and engaging mini games to getting crafty with origami, every lesson in this classroom is an adventure. And if you need to relax, we\u2019ve prepared the latest tech gadgets, fun girl games, books, and board games for you to have a chill time with your classmates during Christmas break.\r\n \r\n\ud83c\udf3f Nature Zone:\r\nReady to explore the great classroom of outdoors? From learning how to nurture plant in our greenhouse, grow fruits and vegetables in the frozen garden to participating in the snail race (yep, you read that right)! Become a part of a scout group for exciting outdoor adventures filled with cosy campfires, snow, marshmallow delights, gifts, and the intriguing mystery of a cute bigfoot hiding among the trees.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd2c Science Class:\r\nEnter the fascinating world of Science Classroom, where curiosity meets creativity! Play in the gravity room, craft your own erupting volcano, and uncover the magic of light with prism experiments. Engage in mini games world to learn about the solar system, black holes, and our atmosphere. And finally, release your imagination by customising your own special plants. Learning has never been this fun!\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf7d\ufe0f Cafeteria and Kitchen Area:\r\nVisit the lively cafeteria and kitchen, where you become the master chef! Customise your own bubble teas, experimenting with endless flavours and toppings to create the perfect drink through fun girl games. Discover delicious meals daily, from Taco Tuesdays to Pizza Thursdays, so there's always something tasty to try. Our fully equipped kitchen has everything you need to cook up dishes. Prepare to awaken your inner chef and join the world of culinary! \r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfa8 Customise Your School:\r\nThis school is all about making it your own! Decorate each classroom with unique winter gifts, stickers, posters, and let your inspiration run wild as you dress your characters in stylish sportswear and vibrant accessories for the big school match day.\r\n \r\n\ud83d\udcda Keep Kids Education Fun:\r\nAt Pepi School, we believe in combining learning with fun to create an interesting and joyful educational experience for kids. Dive into our world of diverse kids games and characters to create your own winter stories and celebrate our differences. Through gameplay, we aim to spread a positive outlook on kids education, inclusion, and diversity to spark a passion for knowledge in kids.\r\n \r\n\ud83d\udd11 Key Features:\r\n\u2022 Seamlessly blend kids education with entertainment for every girl and boy.\r\n\u2022 From sport to math, gardening to the arts, cooking to science.\r\n\u2022 Over 20 inclusive and imaginative characters.\r\n\u2022 Immerse yourself in winter themed school world that reflect real environments to create your school Christmas stories.\r\n\u2022 Explore a variety of girl games, gifts, and combine fun with education.\r\n\u2022 Stay tuned for new frozen holiday updates as school expands with new classrooms, gifts and girl games!\r\n \r\nEveryone is cool at Pepi School! Join your new classmates, and create some winter holiday memories together!\r\n \r\nCan\u2019t wait to see you at school!",
    "descriptionHTML": "\ud83c\udf93\ud83c\udfeb Hey there, Future Schoolmate! \ud83c\udfeb\ud83c\udf93<br> <br>Welcome to always expanding Pepi School world, where the learning never stops and the frozen winter fun never ends! Step into the world of education and create your frozen winter stories by attending your favourite classes, having winter fun with your classmates or decorating classroom of your choice.<br> <br>\ud83c\udf1f Sports Space:<br>Unleash your inner athlete in our sports classroom! We encourage teamwork and staying active, whether you&#39;re kicking it on the soccer field or finding your zen on the yoga mat. So grab a ball or strike a pose, because our interactive environment and fun girl games are seriously fun this winter holiday season!<br> <br>\ud83d\udcda Learning Hub:<br>Discover school&#39;s main classroom and begin a journey of education and laughter! From learning math through puzzles and engaging mini games to getting crafty with origami, every lesson in this classroom is an adventure. And if you need to relax, we\u2019ve prepared the latest tech gadgets, fun girl games, books, and board games for you to have a chill time with your classmates during Christmas break.<br> <br>\ud83c\udf3f Nature Zone:<br>Ready to explore the great classroom of outdoors? From learning how to nurture plant in our greenhouse, grow fruits and vegetables in the frozen garden to participating in the snail race (yep, you read that right)! Become a part of a scout group for exciting outdoor adventures filled with cosy campfires, snow, marshmallow delights, gifts, and the intriguing mystery of a cute bigfoot hiding among the trees.<br><br>\ud83d\udd2c Science Class:<br>Enter the fascinating world of Science Classroom, where curiosity meets creativity! Play in the gravity room, craft your own erupting volcano, and uncover the magic of light with prism experiments. Engage in mini games world to learn about the solar system, black holes, and our atmosphere. And finally, release your imagination by customising your own special plants. Learning has never been this fun!<br><br>\ud83c\udf7d\ufe0f Cafeteria and Kitchen Area:<br>Visit the lively cafeteria and kitchen, where you become the master chef! Customise your own bubble teas, experimenting with endless flavours and toppings to create the perfect drink through fun girl games. Discover delicious meals daily, from Taco Tuesdays to Pizza Thursdays, so there&#39;s always something tasty to try. Our fully equipped kitchen has everything you need to cook up dishes. Prepare to awaken your inner chef and join the world of culinary! <br><br>\ud83c\udfa8 Customise Your School:<br>This school is all about making it your own! Decorate each classroom with unique winter gifts, stickers, posters, and let your inspiration run wild as you dress your characters in stylish sportswear and vibrant accessories for the big school match day.<br> <br>\ud83d\udcda Keep Kids Education Fun:<br>At Pepi School, we believe in combining learning with fun to create an interesting and joyful educational experience for kids. Dive into our world of diverse kids games and characters to create your own winter stories and celebrate our differences. Through gameplay, we aim to spread a positive outlook on kids education, inclusion, and diversity to spark a passion for knowledge in kids.<br> <br>\ud83d\udd11 Key Features:<br>\u2022 Seamlessly blend kids education with entertainment for every girl and boy.<br>\u2022 From sport to math, gardening to the arts, cooking to science.<br>\u2022 Over 20 inclusive and imaginative characters.<br>\u2022 Immerse yourself in winter themed school world that reflect real environments to create your school Christmas stories.<br>\u2022 Explore a variety of girl games, gifts, and combine fun with education.<br>\u2022 Stay tuned for new frozen holiday updates as school expands with new classrooms, gifts and girl games!<br> <br>Everyone is cool at Pepi School! Join your new classmates, and create some winter holiday memories together!<br> <br>Can\u2019t wait to see you at school!",
